  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">INTEGRATED DEVELOPMENT PROGRAMME FOR WOMEN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	To increase the participation of national women&apos;s organisations in public meetings, and to promote debate, decision and action on local development issues.
2.	To formulate proposals for policies on a national level (food security, employment, environment, gender) and encourage the implementation of these public policies, promoting equal opportunities and encouraging decentralisation.
3.	To promote networking and participation of grassroots organisations in public debate on a national level.</narrative>
  </description>
